WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Provenance you can verify

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Every block is pinned by sha256, plus a signed note from the publisher.

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:17.500
The signature is verified in the browser via WebAssembly.

4
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:24.500
Your free text counts as data, not as instructions.

5
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.500
The result carries template_digest and values_digest.

6
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:37.000
If the template is altered, the signature is invalid. Verify, don’t trust.
